// Auth0.xcconfig
// Auth0 tenant configuration — PLACEHOLDER values. No real Auth0 tenant
// exists yet (TECH-SPEC §9/§2a: the one-shot build targets the seam, not a
// live tenant). Real values are provisioned post-run and documented in
// SECRETS.md (added when a real tenant is provisioned); until then these
// placeholders let the app compile and run against MockAuthProvider without
// ever attempting a real network call (Auth0AuthProvider.Config detects the
// placeholder shape and treats the provider as unconfigured).
//
// To wire a real tenant later: replace the two values below (or override
// them from the environment at build time), then re-run `xcodegen generate`.

AUTH0_DOMAIN = your-tenant.us.auth0.com
AUTH0_CLIENT_ID = REPLACE_WITH_REAL_AUTH0_CLIENT_ID
